status GREEN -- invariant_coverage_control 37/37 with every elder leg still passing, scan re-run on the tree, qa_report_card A 91, named guards run at the send
recommend check in (Keaton) -- caravan/farewell.rye holds 742 top-level functions in 11,665 lines and 15 modules stand over 500; TAME's 70-line ratchet has never been pointed at file length, and whether that is a red or a shape wants your word
